Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扔回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just throw it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll dry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:13.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻起来很臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把它倒空\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can empty it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装满艾丽斯小姐的鼠尾草\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff it full of Miss Iris' sage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一些薰衣草\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some of the lavender, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.35,0:00:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就有一只很棒的熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have an awesome bear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾撑过惊涛骇浪  瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that survived the stormy sea, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我像你这么大时也有一只这样的熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had one just like this when I was your age, and --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一击毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没必要戳两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have to twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  又一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  别跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是浮尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not a bobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是得动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still gotta do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:42.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要  只要没人发现就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't, not if people don't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:01:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会告诉别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你会不会说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me if you're gonna tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:04.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是个告密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're a snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是告密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我是不会帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八个生锈的秋葵罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight rusty cans of okra
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和一瓶阿司匹林\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a bottle of aspirin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出来就找到这么多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we got to show for our time out here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我们还活着这一事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}...other than the fact that we're still standin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找东西的第一准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule number one of scavenging --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这世界上尚存的所有东西都是藏起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing left in this world that isn't hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只用找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只用找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么一阵子  我还担心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second there, I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们不该走这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we went farther than we were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面没东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing left out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我们想继续找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have enough gas to keep looking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有足够的汽油  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if we wanted to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们说过要走两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said we'd be gone for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经两周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.39,0:04:26.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要山顶寨遵守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the Hilltop keeps their side of the bargain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:27.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家里就有食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have food at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.57,0:04:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能这样回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go back like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们指望着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's people counting on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么表现得像是不知道一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you acting like you don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定那对我来说还有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that means much to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在卫星站做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we did at the satellite station...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们杀掉的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of those people that we killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没看见  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只看见了剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just saw what was left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也被迫做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们都是被迫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we all had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了一些牛奶和玉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}for some milk and some corn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是唯一的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's -- that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见了你们来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw how we were living back home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在家里是怎么过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you guys got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果要选择自己或者别人  就选择自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's you or someone else, you choose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿走所有东西  如有必要  干掉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take what you can, you take out who you have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就可以继续生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you get to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人是一起的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's in this together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是因为你知道自己刚刚是在胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only hurts because you know what you just said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才会难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}is total bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你  希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not you, Heath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:02.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:13.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:19.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是所有想活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's everybody who wants to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:22.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以向海边走  但今天之后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can push towards the shore, but after today...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}we go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便我们只找到了那些生锈的罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we just have those rusty cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  我自己来  谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昨天在外面有找到什么东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they find anything out there yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:08.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾芙说她到开口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ev said she reached the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:09.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她看见什么了  -什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd she see? - ‭Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一路到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来就该动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:32.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, uh... I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.41,0:14:55.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来伤害你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:14:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家  把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone, just lower your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛蒂  离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyndie, get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没有干什么坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't done anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:17.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是走进来了...爬进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just walked in -- crawled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道自己进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know I was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:25.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:33.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样也没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cool, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就继续这样僵持着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,底下有很多盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lotta blind spots down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先看看防水布后面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check behind the tarps first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子他们计划着做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they had plans for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但似乎没有完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they didn't get to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面可能有什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be something good in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-希斯  -塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heath! - ‭Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得听听她的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to hear what she has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.27,0:19:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  拖的时间越长\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The longer we wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:22.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:22.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的社区就越危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more our community's at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前说好了  假如有人进来了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed to discuss this together as a group
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要小组表决\N{\fnArial\fs30}if someone ever got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很早以前就决定了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made that decision a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们开始前  你需要用下洗手间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, uh, need to use the bathroom before we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Um, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是娜塔尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Natania.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是凯西和碧翠丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kathy and Beatrice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom you've already met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我一个人听到铃声了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one hearing bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们设的铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们设了六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have six of them --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些在附近  有些在几里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}some nearby, some a couple of miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些汽笛声又是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the air horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能找到有限的铃铛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could only find so many bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是用来引走那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are to redirect any of the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被吸引来的行尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might have been drawn by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时是挺有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但风中的树枝  树叶的沙沙作响...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a branch in the wind, leaves rustling...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很幸运这一带还挺干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lucky this is a relatively clear area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:30.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时那些撤离  那些驳船...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evacuations, the barges --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道真假\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they were even real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚特兰大...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是很久之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不断移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just stayed on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.42,0:20:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友和我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend and I --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经自力更生\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've been traveling around
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面闯荡好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our own for a couple years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前在一艘渔船上工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to work on a fishing boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:57.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人跟你一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在什么样的渔船上工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of fishing boat did you work on --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖网渔船  围网渔船还是库船\N{\fnArial\fs30}trawler, seiner, larder?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你说的最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, last one. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须理解  当有人发现来这的方法时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand, we get nervous when people just find their way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}into our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  见识过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend and I --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:27.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现了一个建在桥上的居住地\N{\fnArial\fs30}we found this settlement built on a bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说是被遗弃的居住地\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what was left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:29.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当时在搜刮资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were scavenging,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后被行尸攻击了  就是死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we got attacked by walkers -- the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们设法逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were trying to get away from them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我被撞到了桥下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got knocked off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在水流里挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought the current,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后被冲到了水湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}wound up in the inlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是河口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The estuary?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:44.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是海湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我地理不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not good with geography.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是以为我死在那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I was dead out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.83,0:21:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我到了海岸  就昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got to the shore, and I just passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是温莎河上的桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bridge on Windsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...你知道怎么去那吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- you know how to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没有回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当那个女孩辛蒂给我拿了食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that girl, Cyndie, brought me food,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就假装昏迷  然后跟着她来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just pretended like I was out and I followed her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来她有一个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed like she had a camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.02,0:22:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看我是否能得到帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wanted to see if I could get any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么偷偷摸摸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why were you sneaking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看是否安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see if it was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依然不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉把你们吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry that I freaked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:24.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们告诉我怎么走  我就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you just point me in the right direction, I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:27.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得回到桥那找我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get back to the bridge and look for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we let you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.87,0:22:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会对我们很不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have us at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经了解我们不少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know a great deal about us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.29,0:22:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果你们放我走吗  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you let me go? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常来说  我们已经把你杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, normally, we would've killed you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:43.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陌生人进入营地  我们是格杀勿论的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shoot strangers on sight if they come into our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:46.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但碧翠丝说你没杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Beatrice said you spared her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我的孙女舍命救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my granddaughter almost lost hers trying to save you --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是"那个女孩"辛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That girl," Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.36,0:22:55.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们还剩一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it leaves us with the question still
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是应该怎么处置你\N{\fnArial\fs30}of what to do with you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实难以抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pickle, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.09,0:23:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不妨休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you rest up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之后再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk more later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们有人可以想出好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one of us will have a brainstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.39,0:23:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.06,0:24:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你喜欢吃鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you like fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:28.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dried kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.01,0:24:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她给你的是咸鲈鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought you salted perch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.19,0:24:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.83,0:24:40.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那么喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.82,0:24:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有炖菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两还没有正式见过面对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two haven't formally met, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.92,0:24:49.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉  这是辛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, this is Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:54.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你在海滩上帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, thank you for the beach and...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有之前发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.88,0:24:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.82,0:25:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你奶奶是否完全同意  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't know if your grandma totally approves, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.21,0:25:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她给我指引过方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}She showed me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.98,0:25:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一种方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.02,0:25:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想指给瑞秋看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to show Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.25,0:25:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还没有动过手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't had to do it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.29,0:25:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.42,0:25:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我射得很准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a really good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.86,0:25:37.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.87,0:26:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上一次吃东西是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you ate?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.22,0:26:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酱油包算食物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do soy-sauce packets count as food?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.67,0:26:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里无限供应鱼肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an endless supply of fish here --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.87,0:26:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是住在海边的好处之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the perks of living so close to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.95,0:26:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉  你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um, you think, Tara,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.85,0:26:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能适应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's something you could get used to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.16,0:26:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能劝你留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping to convince you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.09,0:26:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就能完美地解决我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be the perfect solution to our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.95,0:26:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的村庄依然隐秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep our village a secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.82,0:26:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也能安定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'd get to put down roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.55,0:26:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一名厉害的战士  塔拉  也是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a skilled fighter, Tara, and a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.20,0:26:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会抛下任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be leaving anything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.27,0:26:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想要的话  我们能帮你找到你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you want, we can help you find your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.07,0:26:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他愿意留下来  我们也能给他一个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he wants to stay, we'll offer him a home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.84,0:26:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也能留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.16,0:26:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a reason why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.43,0:26:44.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没想到我会问这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I never thought I'd be asking this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.63,0:26:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这里的男人哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but where are all the men?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.98,0:27:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.34,0:27:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们和另一群人起了点冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got into a skirmish with another group.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.85,0:27:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们全都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.47,0:27:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也损失了不少女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we lost others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.79,0:27:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛蒂本来还有个11岁的弟弟  我的小孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyndie had an 11-year-old brother, my grandson,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他们的母亲  我的女儿也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their mother, too, my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来  我们决定不管怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, we decided to protect ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.65,0:27:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都要保护好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我们碰见谁  都格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter who we crossed, we would kill on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.28,0:27:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们收拾了几件衣服  就离开了原来的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We left our old home with just the clothes on our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们找到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.33,0:27:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会一直躲在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.58,0:27:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会一直活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we would stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉  你本来可以伤害我们  但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, you could have hurt us, and you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你肯定觉得我们是一群禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know we must sound like monsters to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:27:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我必须把实话告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I had to be honest
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.62,0:28:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样或许你能理解我们为什么这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe you could understand why we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.45,0:28:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你也能实话告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe you could be honest with us
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.04,0:28:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}about where you're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.08,0:28:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.29,0:28:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你在渔船上工作过  库船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you worked on a fishing boat, a larder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.38,0:28:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉  库船是储藏肉类的仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, a larder is a room used for storing meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.29,0:28:25.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我是在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.37,0:28:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来自一个社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come from a community.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.56,0:28:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确就是一个社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's really what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.71,0:28:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们住在一起  相互扶持\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live with each other. We help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.67,0:28:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有墙  房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have walls, houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.19,0:28:47.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个让我挂念的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a girlfriend I want to get back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.07,0:28:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've done things...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.37,0:28:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你们一样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.18,0:29:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们威胁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were threatening us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.06,0:29:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现他们的行动基地是一个老卫星站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found out they were using an old satellite station to operate out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.38,0:29:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们趁半夜去到那里  然后我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went out there in the middle of the night, and we...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.83,0:29:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉了他们  每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}took them out, every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.18,0:29:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人都是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people got what they deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.82,0:29:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们选择杀戮和威胁别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They chose to kill and to terrorize people,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:22.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不是因此而杀他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's not why we killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.02,0:29:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是为了让这个世界变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do it to make the world a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.12,0:29:29.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是为了活命  和你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it because we wanted to stay alive, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:32.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们认为让我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that you think that me staying
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.02,0:29:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.80,0:29:35.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how's this for brainstorming --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.11,0:29:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们两个团体能合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe our groups can start working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just told you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不希望任何人知道这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we don't want anyone to know about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.06,0:29:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能永远这么活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live like that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.04,0:29:43.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.79,0:29:46.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我明白你们这样做的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I -- I get why you're doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们一直把所有人都当做敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you keep seeing everyone as an enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.59,0:29:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们就只有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}then enemies are all you're gonna find.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.96,0:29:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们迟早会需要朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, you're gonna need a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.70,0:29:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以相互保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can protect each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.22,0:29:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会比之前更安全...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be safer than we are --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.19,0:30:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.90,0:30:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能派人给她带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could send a guide out with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮她找她的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help her look for her friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后一起去他们的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then continue on to their community,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.67,0:30:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是去看看那里是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just -- just to see what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.65,0:30:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.18,0:30:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟她一块去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.03,0:30:29.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.40,0:30:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前没有留路线方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left without leaving a routing plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.54,0:30:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有跟守卫通告就擅自离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}without signing with the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.13,0:30:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛蒂  我以为我们谈过这些问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyndie, I thought we were through with all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.87,0:30:37.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你学会什么叫责任之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be staying behind the fence
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.45,0:30:40.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都要在围栏里待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you learn some responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.72,0:30:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这事成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this works out,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.62,0:30:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有很多别的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}there will be plenty of other chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.85,0:30:47.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.12,0:30:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想你待在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.10,0:30:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有别的机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be other chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.14,0:31:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没有叫库船的渔船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure there isn't a fishing boat called a larder?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.57,0:31:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还蛮确定有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm, like, pretty sure that --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.04,0:31:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没有  -那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There isn't. - ‭Yeah. Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.69,0:31:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切会有好转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna get better --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.55,0:31:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}people getting together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.06,0:31:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界就能像之前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how the world is gonna be the world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.99,0:31:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.48,0:31:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛蒂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Cyndie?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.54,0:31:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在房间里生闷气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in the cabin, sulking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是她遵守了规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't be doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不会做这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for her breaking all the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.15,0:31:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运  塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.05,0:31:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.64,0:31:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之后再多练习下  娜塔尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, we'll -- we'll work on that, Natania.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.36,0:31:44.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.83,0:31:45.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.65,0:31:49.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回见了  瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.86,0:32:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碧翠丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Beatrice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about the hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.76,0:32:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.93,0:32:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.15,0:32:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离桥还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far are we to the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.47,0:32:43.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一半路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}About halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.10,0:32:45.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里林子很密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty thick through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.73,0:33:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.68,0:34:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.73,0:34:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在村里时我本可以杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have killed you back in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.43,0:34:52.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.74,0:34:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.68,0:34:58.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.30,0:35:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.31,0:35:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们捣毁的那个卫星站\N{\fnArial\fs30}That satellite post you took out --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.91,0:35:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们完全不知道自己惹上了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have no idea what you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.61,0:35:09.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都没惹上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't start anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.58,0:35:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们终结了一切  他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ended it. They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.20,0:35:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.00,0:35:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也阻止不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是个哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just an outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.03,0:35:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有更多  更多的救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more -- more Saviors...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更多的哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}more outposts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.07,0:35:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要是知道你的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they know about your friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.08,0:35:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们就已经没救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's already too late for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.68,0:35:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}they did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:38.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们把你们所有男性都杀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the ones that killed all your men?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:47.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有超过十岁的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}every boy over 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.86,0:35:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们让他们排好队  用枪射他们的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lined 'em up, shot 'em in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.87,0:35:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们反抗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we tried to fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.07,0:35:57.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.43,0:36:00.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.43,0:36:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本该一直替他们工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were supposed to keep working for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.94,0:36:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后某一晚  我们逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one night, we just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们脱身了  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got away, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.23,0:36:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会让你把他们引回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not gonna let you lead them back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.93,0:36:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会得到他们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.87,0:36:22.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you didn't get --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.00,0:36:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.92,0:36:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.29,0:37:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.67,0:37:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我救了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I saved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.45,0:37:06.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救了三次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.29,0:37:08.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.11,0:37:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.51,0:37:16.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远不会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you'll never come back
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远不会说出我们这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll never tell anyone about us,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.87,0:37:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你们自己人也不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.03,0:37:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why...would I come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.98,0:37:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要对别人说这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I tell anyone about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.79,0:37:33.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为也许你能得到一些好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because maybe you could get something out of it --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.03,0:37:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.77,0:37:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么杀掉那两个靠近我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we kill those two people who just came near us?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.51,0:37:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么杀掉卫星站里的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kill all those people at that satellite station?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.42,0:37:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们都以为必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you all thought you had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.19,0:37:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}But none of you had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.41,0:37:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们只是做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.94,0:38:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.66,0:38:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是选择了忘记自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just decide to forget who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.55,0:38:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人真是坏人  辛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are evil, Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.70,0:38:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我必须现在就回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I have to get back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.97,0:38:30.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.54,0:38:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.68,0:38:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.03,0:38:52.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.52,0:38:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你去桥上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.42,0:38:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次别掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to fall off this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.74,0:39:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不只这些  对吗  -对  还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's more, right? - Yeah, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.77,0:39:17.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用车作掩护  直到被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll use the cars as cover until I can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.62,0:39:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.76,0:39:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll run.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.54,0:39:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.99,0:39:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最喜欢的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my favorite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.13,0:39:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑不过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.63,0:39:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.14,0:39:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经帮过了  你送我来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already did. You got me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.61,0:39:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧  告诉她们我袭击了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go back. Tell them that I attacked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.28,0:39:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们了解你  塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know you, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.42,0:39:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  告诉她们你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, tell them you killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.53,0:39:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们也了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.83,0:39:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不会去任何地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not going anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.83,0:39:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你安全抵达另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you get to the other side -- safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.78,0:39:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有枪  我有子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got my rifle. I've got ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.71,0:39:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我送你来这里不是看你死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get you here just to watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.98,0:39:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们快点完事吧  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just get this over with, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.10,0:40:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯西和碧翠丝  她们知道我们要来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy and Beatrice -- they know we were coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.24,0:40:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.01,0:40:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.47,0:40:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么跟她们其他人不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you like the rest of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.51,0:40:16.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了这么多事以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after everything that's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.62,0:40:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.33,0:40:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.80,0:41:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  上那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, up on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.01,0:41:29.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.86,0:42:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.04,0:42:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.22,0:42:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希斯  我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.56,0:42:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.76,0:42:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  快跑  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.02,0:43:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.20,0:43:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.50,0:44:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.66,0:44:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.51,0:45:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(太阳镜  古玩)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到亚历山大安全区   迷途者的天堂  掠夺者的地狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.38,0:47:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾  塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.38,0:48:00.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不用只坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.97,0:48:07.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪  弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns, ammunition...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.15,0:48:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have any leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.27,0:48:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何东西  任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.66,0:48:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管那里看起来有多么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care how dangerous it looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.84,0:48:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.43,0:48:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.30,0:48:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.30,0:48:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can square this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.24,0:48:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以纠正这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.31,0:48:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.10,0:48:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.20,0:48:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面没找到任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see anything like that out there.
